        {
          "name": "Me",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "{{locale}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{technician_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/technician/me",
            "description": "Account screen bootstrap.\n\nResponse:\n```json\n{\n  \"user\": { },\n  \"technician\": {\n    \"availability_status\": \"available\",\n    \"availability_status_label\": \"متاح\",\n    \"is_accepting_orders\": true,\n    \"estimated_job_duration_minutes\": 60,\n    \"queued_orders_count\": 0,\n    \"estimated_wait_minutes\": 0,\n    \"estimated_wait_label\": \"...\"\n  },\n  \"availability_options\": [\n    { \"value\": \"offline\", \"label\": \"غير متصل\" },\n    { \"value\": \"available\", \"label\": \"متاح\" },\n    { \"value\": \"busy\", \"label\": \"مشغول\" },\n    { \"value\": \"on_break\", \"label\": \"في استراحة\" }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n`estimated_job_duration_minutes` is a default for settings/queue math — not for displaying a specific order.\n\nQueue snapshot may include estimated_wait_working_days, estimated_busy_label, estimated_next_available_at, estimated_next_available_relative_label."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update me (account statuses)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "{{locale}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{technician_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"availability_status\": \"available\",\n  \"is_accepting_orders\": true,\n  \"estimated_job_duration_minutes\": 90\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/technician/me",
            "description": "**Preferred for My Account (حسابي).** Update any combination of:\n- `availability_status`: `offline` | `available` | `busy` | `on_break`\n- `is_accepting_orders`: bool (while true, cancel of assigned orders is blocked)\n- `estimated_job_duration_minutes`: technician default only (1–10080), nullable to clear\n\nAt least one field required. Response same shape as GET `/me` including refreshed `availability_options`.\n\nExamples:\n- Available: `{ \"availability_status\": \"available\" }`\n- Busy: `{ \"availability_status\": \"busy\" }`\n- Stop receiving orders: `{ \"is_accepting_orders\": false }`"
          }
        },
