    {
      "name": "Orders",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List orders (work queue)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const data = pm.response.json().data || [];",
                  "  const accept = data.find(o => o.can_accept === true);",
                  "  const withOffer = data.find(o => o.pending_offer_id);",
                  "  const pick = accept || withOffer || data[0];",
                  "  if (pick && pick.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('order_id', String(pick.id));",
                  "  if (pick && pick.pending_offer_id) pm.collectionVariables.set('offer_id', String(pick.pending_offer_id));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "{{locale}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{technician_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/technician/orders",
            "description": "Work queue + history for this technician (inspection paid only).\n\nSorted: `queue_position` ASC (nulls last), then `assigned_at`, then `id` DESC.\n\nEach row includes:\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": 1,\n  \"order_number\": \"...\",\n  \"status\": \"assigned\",\n  \"status_label\": \"تم تعيين فني\",\n  \"status_group\": \"waiting\",\n  \"status_group_label\": \"في الانتظار\",\n  \"customer\": { \"id\": 1, \"user\": { \"name\": \"...\", \"phone\": \"...\" } },\n  \"service_category\": { },\n  \"company\": { },\n  \"scheduled_at\": \"2026-11-12T13:00:00+00:00\",\n  \"estimated_duration_minutes\": 60,\n  \"queue_position\": 1,\n  \"can_accept\": true,\n  \"can_start_trip\": false,\n  \"can_mark_arrived\": false,\n  \"can_move_to_payment\": false,\n  \"can_complete\": false,\n  \"can_cancel\": false,\n  \"pending_offer_id\": null,\n  \"allowed_next_statuses\": [\n    { \"value\": \"accepted\", \"label\": \"...\", \"status_group\": \"waiting\", \"status_group_label\": \"في الانتظار\" }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\nUI: show Accept when `can_accept === true`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Show order",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
