                  "  if (order && order.pending_offer_id) pm.collectionVariables.set('offer_id', String(order.pending_offer_id));",
                  "  if (order && order.items && order.items[0] && order.items[0].id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('item_id', String(order.items[0].id));",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "{{locale}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{technician_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/technician/orders/{{order_id}}",
            "description": "Full detail. Response wrapper: `{ \"order\": { ... } }` (not top-level `data`).\n\nAdds on top of list fields:\n- `customer_address`\n- `service_problem`\n- `items`, `payments`\n- `status_histories` (timeline)\n- `intake_answers`\n- `custom_problem_text`, `customer_notes`\n- Schedule: `scheduled_at`, `estimated_duration_minutes`, `schedule_note`, `schedule_summary`, `is_schedule_manual`, `can_update_schedule`, `schedule_updated_by`\n\nDo **not** show account `estimated_job_duration_minutes` as this order's appointment."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update order schedule",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "{{locale}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{technician_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"scheduled_at\": \"2026-11-17T14:30:00+03:00\",\n  \"estimated_duration_minutes\": 90,\n  \"schedule_note\": \"موعد تقريبي بعد الظهر\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/technician/orders/{{order_id}}/schedule",
            "description": "Set **this order's** appointment from order details when `can_update_schedule=true`.\n\nBody (at least one field):\n- `scheduled_at` ISO8601\n- `estimated_duration_minutes` 1–10080\n- `schedule_note` written note shown in details\n\nSets `is_schedule_manual=true` (queue will not overwrite this appointment) and posts a `schedule_update` message into the order chat.\n\nResponse: `{ order }` including `schedule_summary`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List order messages (chat)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "{{locale}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{technician_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/technician/orders/{{order_id}}/messages",
            "description": "Chat thread with the customer on this order. Includes `text` and `schedule_update` messages."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Send order message",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "{{locale}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{technician_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"body\": \"هل يناسبك الموعد المقترح؟\",\n  \"scheduled_at\": \"2026-11-17T15:00:00+03:00\",\n  \"estimated_duration_minutes\": 75,\n  \"schedule_note\": \"اقتراح موعد بديل\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/technician/orders/{{order_id}}/messages",
            "description": "`body` required. Optional schedule fields also apply a schedule update (and add a schedule_update chat line).\n\nResponse: `{ message, order }`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Accept assigned order (status=accepted)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "{{locale}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{technician_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"accepted\",\n  \"estimated_duration_minutes\": 90,\n  \"note\": \"Accepted from Postman\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/technician/orders/{{order_id}}/status",
            "description": "When `can_accept=true` (`status=assigned`).\n\nBody:\n- `status` (required): `accepted`\n- `estimated_duration_minutes` (optional, 1–10080): sets **this order's** duration and recalculates queue `scheduled_at` values\n- `note` (optional)\n\nAfter success: `can_accept=false`, `can_start_trip=true`, `status_group=waiting`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "On the way",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
